            </section>

            <div class="editor-save-bar sticky bottom-3 z-20 flex flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-xl border border-plum bg-ink/95 p-4 text-white shadow-2xl backdrop-blur md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between [&_button]:min-h-11 [&_button]:rounded-lg [&_button]:bg-gold [&_button]:px-4 [&_button]:py-2.5 [&_button]:text-[10px] [&_button]:font-extrabold [&_button]:text-ink"><div><strong>Ready to publish?</strong><span>Saving updates the public homepage immediately.</span></div><button type="submit" wire:loading.attr="disabled"><span wire:loading.remove wire:target="save">Save all changes</span><span wire:loading wire:target="save">Saving…</span></button></div>
